Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:32:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ui: Material 3 mode switch and server list on the working
 screen

The mode control is a SegmentedButton over the two modes the product has, and the
servers render as ListTile rows: name left, delay right, selected row tinted. Both
are Material components, so the screen keeps the platform's behaviour (ripples,
semantics, density) instead of a hand-drawn approximation.
